{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>金曲歌王蕭敬騰2024年婚禮上的經典誓詞「六月是夏天、夏天是Summer、Summer是林有慧、林有慧是我老婆」，近日再度成為網路熱議話題。</p><p>一名網友在Threads分享，自己準備入睡時腦中竟不停響起這段台詞，笑到完全睡不著，貼文意外釣出老婆林有慧本人現身回覆「不好意思打擾你的睡眠」，短短十字讓網友全笑翻。</p><figure><img alt=\"蕭敬騰與老婆林有慧Summer的相片（Instagram@jam_hsiao0330）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251215/1077198958436028416024873.jpeg/SK1IZmaSCdFQsuf694kIgRlW5KaKqEhGKcNUBSnDVAU\"/><figcaption>蕭敬騰與老婆林有慧Summer的相片（Instagram@jam_hsiao0330）</figcaption></figure><p>重溫蕭敬騰高調求婚林有慧畫面：</p><figure><img alt=\"蕭敬騰求婚畫面（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230628/750734140042645504462590.png/bfiOw2cy3NKkFgRa8EjLEv9DnIc0x5VJjZ5RLI2eUSw\"/><figcaption>蕭敬騰求婚畫面（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蕭敬騰求婚畫面（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230628/750734142534193152536401.png/rgIF90-3lNTRFuWe7kpyfStzEfGKievbANXMmADVzJg\"/><figcaption>蕭敬騰求婚畫面（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蕭敬騰求婚畫面（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230628/750734145306759168079825.png/EydGJq7unAXwE-xgK3RzZnB0-Y4jABiwMs8EDTLPBA0\"/><figcaption>蕭敬騰求婚畫面（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蕭敬騰求婚畫面（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230628/750734148133851136951367.png/meFflHyZIDGGlW6-p-0nnLzGqTdhEMChQv9St0L_Urc\"/><figcaption>蕭敬騰求婚畫面（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蕭敬騰求婚畫面（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230628/750734150822531072720981.png/6bJNB7sjWc-Ubo4LGvp77qhgXtDPZn_3PTdkkD03ZJA\"/><figcaption>蕭敬騰求婚畫面（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蕭敬騰求婚畫面（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230628/750734153653817344185206.png/HOd_FQ4_1_x9qPTW7_WrElZgR6PY_P31pDtRyqQ7Uco\"/><figcaption>蕭敬騰求婚畫面（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蕭敬騰求婚畫面（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230628/750734156166336512823056.png/zewgAId_GGN96O8xKyCoQ_ZDA9FsQRvgG4B8cBuAfHA\"/><figcaption>蕭敬騰求婚畫面（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蕭敬騰求婚畫面（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230628/750734159211532288027348.png/Elh4tCRPyE9PetiGh0GjPwweQRhl9VAZbcrlFW3K5RU\"/><figcaption>蕭敬騰求婚畫面（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蕭敬騰求婚畫面（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230628/750734162151870464789162.png/FS4FEKERCZvbUO3IHY5CfZ1ThRVfqjW1LA2vlywNr5c\"/><figcaption>蕭敬騰求婚畫面（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蕭敬騰求婚畫面（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230628/750734164588892160148320.png/AI3hLr_yp3s4fb8FDjiX42-NuKd_9Gf0a8_woWvP8KE\"/><figcaption>蕭敬騰求婚畫面（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"老蕭（右二）向經紀人Summer求婚成功，周董（右）和老婆昆凌也在場見證。（喜鵲娛樂）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230628/750734309521887232059386.jpeg/JcSATgpXc_tO3OzroEss0A7CTHgwz50sRLv0X0S79F8\"/><figcaption>老蕭（右二）向經紀人Summer求婚成功，周董（右）和老婆昆凌也在場見證。（喜鵲娛樂）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"老蕭（左）甜蜜激吻未婚妻Summer。（喜鵲娛樂）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230628/750734431135862784068319.jpeg/_FQwYpsQ5Ti8FkH7mU7brhw1W0BNwVo7QQQ3t0EEN7c\"/><figcaption>老蕭（左）甜蜜激吻未婚妻Summer。（喜鵲娛樂）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230628/750734139199590400812576.png/e-VXQCl71vxPexTrI2rx93PdrdPFg5JHBNgY6wTYGOs\"/><figcaption>（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230628/750734141967962112560489.png/dsCBaWSTh0MOuxmT4eayYfCZBZhpNgQLWJ1lI1idZSM\"/><figcaption>（截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>林有慧本尊現身回覆</p><p>該名網友發文表示，本來已經快睡著，眼睛閉上後腦中卻突然浮現蕭敬騰的聲音，不斷重複婚禮上的經典誓詞，害他躺在床上笑到停不下來。貼文曝光後迅速引發熱議，累積超過65萬次瀏覽、4萬讚，更意外釣出Summer林有慧親自現身留言區幽默回應。</p><figure><img alt=\"一名網友在Threads分享，自己準備入睡時腦中竟不停響起這段台詞，笑到完全睡不著，貼文意外釣出老婆林有慧本人現身回覆「不好意思打擾你的睡眠」，短短十字讓網友全笑翻。（Threads@summer_lin_627）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260702/1149375925515718656283461.png/0v3n-r9dYIohBTepIB29oY_fHvY2S8aCB-gkHQfoJB0\"/><figcaption>一名網友在Threads分享，自己準備入睡時腦中竟不停響起這段台詞，笑到完全睡不著，貼文意外釣出老婆林有慧本人現身回覆「不好意思打擾你的睡眠」，短短十字讓網友全笑翻。（Threads@summer_lin_627）</figcaption></figure><p>Summer的回覆讓網友直呼：</p><p>「本人竟然來了」</p><p>「真的回不去了」</p><p>「現在換我腦中開始循環」</p><p>紛紛表示看到留言又忍不住重播婚禮片段。怎料Summer又回「我是很有誠意的道歉」，網友立刻再去回味經典結婚畫面，讓Summer苦笑「我現在才發現我的表情」。</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀：吳建豪再婚妻身份曝光　為日本歌手荒卷繪美　5月時已在美國登記】荒卷繪美Emi Aramaki（Instagram@emiaramaki_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260630/1148562993936601088931760.jpeg/_XLI9NUJvC5-06ns606xRA7EnSl2URRxIF_IjiBfyI4\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：吳建豪再婚妻身份曝光　為日本歌手荒卷繪美　5月時已在美國登記】荒卷繪美Emi Aramaki（Instagram@emiaramaki_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"吳建豪6月29日無預警在IG曬出戴着婚戒牽手的照片。（IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148247612961329152124970.jpeg/zPPjRHEjoT26hw8A8PT1jrKG_0hQJtmRGC_eghgv3oI\"/><figcaption>吳建豪6月29日無預警在IG曬出戴着婚戒牽手的照片。（IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"荒卷繪美Emi Aramaki（Instagram@emiaramaki_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260630/1148563355200393216493872.jpeg/4IsB_57PNmPWpcWhp_RULVwOf559eLtQsyds0LMnbNA\"/><figcaption>荒卷繪美Emi Aramaki（Instagram@emiaramaki_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"荒卷繪美Emi Aramaki（Instagram@emiaramaki_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260630/1148563357738078208124053.jpeg/ruFbRocPEDArNpWKmMY9IEJE2PmM-RfAZFvFV2RbxVc\"/><figcaption>荒卷繪美Emi Aramaki（Instagram@emiaramaki_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"荒卷繪美Emi Aramaki（Instagram@emiaramaki_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260630/1148563360099602432240769.jpeg/g8raS9FAC0I-pjFuDD1Fh1PbPRFjyNIrZcj98WXI_fE\"/><figcaption>荒卷繪美Emi Aramaki（Instagram@emiaramaki_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"荒卷繪美Emi Aramaki（Instagram@emiaramaki_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260630/1148563362473709568015896.jpeg/VzI2WSoO0lq3m5uLEmQBN2MH6VFeodywXq9svF6vbLw\"/><figcaption>荒卷繪美Emi Aramaki（Instagram@emiaramaki_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"荒卷繪美Emi Aramaki（Instagram@emiaramaki_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260630/1148563364885565440803254.jpeg/rtMEbOPj_E6RoZ