gram@emiaramaki_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260630/1148563253442777088614750.jpeg/i4683lj7d7Ps1ysQixMA6HcWhY_XIvdJF8knuRfJJ7k\"/><figcaption>荒卷繪美Emi Aramaki（Instagram@emiaramaki_）</figcaption></figure><p>《天龍八部》國寶級男星辭世　享壽82歲</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-02T12:40:15.657867+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1430,"images":31,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}